  "executiveSummary": "This comprehensive action plan builds upon the successful implementation of the Distributed Memory Management System (DMMS), which was completed on March 18, 2025, approximately three weeks ahead of schedule. Following a detailed analysis of the system's strengths, challenges, and strategic alignment, this document outlines specific actions to maximize the system's value and impact for UcF's April 2025 business relaunch and beyond. The plan is organized into immediate (7 days), short-term (30 days), and medium-term (60 days) actions across five strategic areas: Documentation and Knowledge Capture, User Training and Adoption, Performance Optimization, Platform Integration, and Strategic Enhancement. By implementing these actions, UcF will transform the DMMS from a successful technical implementation into a strategic business asset that delivers measurable value across all departments.",
